    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68846" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοτ-ός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>tent, tampon, lint pledget</i>
			for dressing wounds, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VC</u>
				14
			</span></i>: dat. pl. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					3.82
				</span></i>
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μότοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Heliod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				44.11.11
			</span></i>: 
				Ep.
			gen.pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοτάων</span> (as if
			from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μοτή</span></b> ) <i><span class="en">
				Q.S.
				4.212
			</span></i>: neut. pl. <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μότα</span></b> ,
				τά, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				7.40
			</span></i> P., <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drainage tube</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. κασσιτέρινος κοῖλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Morb.</u>
					2.47
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. στερεός</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				59
			</span></i>.</div>
